      "created_at": "2017-12-07T18:21:45.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Heyo!</p><p>Playing through the Starter Kit with some friends, and I had a question about Bunker's Turret Mode, specifically BUDDABUDDABUDDABUDDA:</p><p>How does it interact with his other abilities?</p><p>Does it buff each one of Bunker's grenades in his grenade launcher?</p><p>Does it make Omni-Cannon double up on dice?</p><p>Or is it only meant to be used with normal attacks? If so, is the benefit of it that it technically hits a bit harder than a Grenade Launcher would to a single target?</p><p>My players couldn't really figure out what the major benefit was, so they ended up not using Turret Mode.</p><p>Thanks!</p>",
