      "created_at": "2017-12-07T19:02:21.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I think they meant to say \"Whenever you use the Attack basic action,\" because you're right, it doesn't make any sense as written when you use Grenade Launcher or Omni-Blast.&nbsp; But then if that's the case, I don't know why it's an Inherent ability when it could just be an Active one.&nbsp; So good question!</p>",
