      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>I think they meant to say &quot;Whenever you use the Attack basic action,&quot; because you&#39;re right, it doesn&#39;t make any sense as written when you use Grenade Launcher or Omni-Blast.&nbsp; But then if that&#39;s the case, I don&#39;t know why it&#39;s an Inherent ability when it could just be an Active one.&nbsp; So good question!</p>",
