      "created_at": "2017-12-07T21:17:58.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>\n&gt; <span>Or is it only meant to be used with normal attacks? If so, is the benefit of it that it technically hits a bit harder than a Grenade Launcher would to a single target?\n</span></p><p><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Open Sans, HelveticaNeue, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span>It's a mistake (we're compiling errata to release later) and should be an Action. It hits a single target harder than Grenade Launcher and doesn't backfire like Grenade Launcher can (for example, it's safer to fire in a populated area, like in certain fights in Megalopolis...)</span></font></p>",
      "post_number": 3,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:40:52.051Z",
